          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145555,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist das Schlüsselwort, das entscheidet, ob ein Codeblock ausgeführt werden soll oder nicht?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>if</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>when</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>if</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145556,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code den Anfang der if-Anweisung.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>if</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145557,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code die Variable, die die Anzeigeanweisung überspringt.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"59\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorUnlocked = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hasKey) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You open the treasure door!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>hasKey</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145558,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showHUD = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (showHUD) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HUD enabled&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>HUD enabled</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nichts</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>HUD enabled</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145559,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setze die Klammern zusammen und füge eine Bedingung ein, die den Code zwischen den geschweiften Klammern ausführt.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn an enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>(</code>, gefolgt von <code>true</code> und schließlich <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145560,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Operatoren können wir verwenden, um Vergleiche für Bedingungen in if-Anweisungen zu machen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code> und <code>&lt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code> und <code>&amp;&amp;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Keiner von ihnen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code> und <code>&lt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145561,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Schreibe einen Vergleich, der den Text anzeigt, wenn <code>playerHealth</code> kleiner oder gleich <code>maxHealth</code> ist.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;maxHealth&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" maxHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth &lt;= maxHealth) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health is within limits&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>playerHealth</code>, gefolgt von <code>&lt;=</code> und schließlich <code>maxHealth</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145562,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was passiert, wenn wir zwei Zahlen mit unterschiedlichen Werten mit <code>===</code> vergleichen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Wir erhalten den booleschen Wert <code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Wir erhalten den booleschen Wert <code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Wir erhalten eine Zahl</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wir erhalten den booleschen Wert <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Warum sollten wir manchmal die Ergebnisse von Vergleichen in Variablen speichern?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Um die Ergebnisse der Vergleiche wiederzuverwenden</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um immer einen Codeblock zu überspringen</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Um immer einen Codeblock auszuführen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Um die Ergebnisse der Vergleiche wiederzuverwenden.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145564,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verwende eine Variable, die das Ergebnis eines Vergleichs speichert, als Bedingung der if-Anweisung.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players &gt; 1\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isMultiplayer = players &gt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isMultiplayer) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Choose characters for each player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>isMultiplayer</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145565,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie nennen wir den Teil einer <code>if</code> / <code>else</code>-Anweisung, der ausgeführt wird, wenn die Bedingung der <code>if</code>-Anweisung <code>false</code> ist?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Eine <code>else</code>-Anweisung</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es gibt keine solche Bedingung</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Eine <code>if</code>-Anweisung</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Eine <code>else</code>-Anweisung.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145566,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code eine leere <code>if</code>-Anweisung (hat keinen Codeblock), die überprüft, ob <code>gameState</code> gleich <code>\"paused\"</code> ist, gefolgt von einer leeren <code>else</code>-Anweisung.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else (gameState !== &quot;paused)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameState === \" /><text value=\"&quot;paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>if</code>, gefolgt von <code>(gameState === \"paused\")</code> und schließlich <code>}</code>, <code>else</code>, <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145567,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Warum hat die <code>else</code>-Anweisung keine eigene Bedingung in Klammern?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Weil sein Codeblock immer ausgeführt wird, wenn die <code>if</code>-Bedingung nicht erfüllt ist</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Weil es immer läuft, braucht es keine Bedingung</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Die <code>else</code>-Anweisung hat keine Bedingung in Klammern</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Weil sein Codeblock immer ausgeführt wird, wenn die <code>if</code>-Bedingung nicht erfüllt ist.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145568,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was passiert, wenn <code>enemyCount</code> einen Wert kleiner als 3 hat?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyCount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemyCount &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss fight unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Keep exploring&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Der Codeblock der <code>else</code>-Anweisung wird ausgeführt</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Der Codeblock der <code>if</code>-Anweisung wird ausgeführt</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Weder der <code>if</code>-Codeblock noch der Codeblock der <code>else</code>-Anweisung wird ausgeführt</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Der Codeblock der <code>else</code>-Anweisung wird ausgeführt.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145569,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wähle einen Wert für <code>rageMeter</code>, sodass der <code>else</code>-Block ausgeführt wird.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rageMeter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Titan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (rageMeter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enrage mode!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + bossName + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not angry enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>79</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 145570,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth === \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You are down!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Low health warning.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Low health warning.</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>You are down!</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Game over</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Low health warning.</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 145571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code die Schlüsselwörter für eine <code>else if</code>-Anweisung.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"78\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level === \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tutorial started.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level === \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemies get tougher.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>else if</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 145572,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"45\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highScore = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score === highScore) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You tied the high score!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt; highScore) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;New high score!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Try again to beat the record!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Versuche erneut, den Rekord zu schlagen!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>New high score!</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Du hast den Highscore erreicht!</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Versuche erneut, den Rekord zu schlagen!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 145573,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige eine Nachricht in der Konsole an, wenn <code>gameMode</code> nicht gleich <code>\"survival\"</code> oder <code>\"hardcore\"</code> ist.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option startIndex=\"165\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"205\" endIndex=\"206\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameMode = \" /><text value=\"&quot;story&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameMode === \" /><text value=\"&quot;survival&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No checkpoints.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameMode === \" /><text value=\"&quot;hardcore&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;One life only.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Checkpoints enabled.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>else</code>, gefolgt von <code>{</code> und schließlich <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #20",
            "id": 145574,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was passiert, wenn die Bedingungen der <code>if</code>-Anweisung und der <code>else if</code>-Anweisungen <code>false</code> zurückgeben?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (ammo &gt; \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &amp;&amp; ammo &lt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ammo is almost full&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (ammo &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ammo is full&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nichts wird in der Konsole angezeigt</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Ammo is almost full</code> wird in der Konsole angezeigt</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Ammo is full</code> wird in der Konsole angezeigt</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nichts wird in der Konsole angezeigt.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
